Think: Now I need to validate these IP addresses to ensure each octet is between 0-255. I'll use awk to check each IP address and only keep valid ones.

Act: bash

```bash
awk -F. '{
    if (NF == 4 && $1 >= 0 && $1 <= 255 && $2 >= 0 && $2 <= 255 && $3 >= 0 && $3 <= 255 && $4 >= 0 && $4 <= 255)
        print $0
}' temp_workspace/ips_only.txt > temp_workspace/valid_ips.txt
```
